    },
    "Address 前倾大于 45°，容易在下杆时主动起身（early extension）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your address tilt is over 45°, which makes you stand up out of posture on the downswing (early extension)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address 时右脚内侧主动蹬地,带动右髋向后转。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At address, push off the inside of your trail foot to drive your trail hip back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address 时脊柱几乎竖直，挥杆面会过于平直，容易薄/顶球。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At address your spine is nearly upright, so the swing plane gets too flat and you tend to thin or top the ball."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address 时髋向后坐 + 上身前倾 25-30°，下巴对着球。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At address, sit your hips back and tilt your upper body forward 25-30°, chin pointing at the ball."
          }
        }
      }
    },
