    "swings:%lld" : {

    },
    "Top 不追求最大转幅,左肩到下巴下方即可停。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, don't chase a huge turn — stop once your lead shoulder is under your chin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 后停 0.2 秒再下杆，重心转移先于手臂发力。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pause 0.2 seconds at the top, then start down—let your weight shift before your arms fire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 后立刻启动下杆，让髋先于手臂触发。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start the downswing right at the top, letting your hips fire before your arms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时主动让左肩转到下巴下方，髋部保持稳定不跟着转过去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, turn your lead shoulder under your chin and keep your hips stable so they don't spin through with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时左肩要转到下巴下方,左臂尽量伸直。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, turn your lead shoulder under your chin and keep your lead arm as straight as you can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时肩转动不到 70°,挥杆弧线短,失去距离。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top your shoulders turn less than 70°, so your arc is short and you lose distance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时肩转动超过 110°,Top 位失控,下杆容易失去节奏。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your shoulders turn past 110° at the top—it gets out of control and you lose your tempo coming down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时肩髋分离不到 25°，意味着躯干没有储能。理想 X-factor 是 35-45°。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top your shoulder-hip separation is under 25°, so your torso isn't storing energy. The ideal X-factor is 35-45°."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时肩髋分离超过 60°,身体超出柔韧度,容易引发下背部代偿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top your shoulder-hip separation goes past 60°, beyond your flexibility, which tends to force your lower back to compensate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时髋只转了不到 25°,下半身没有参与挥杆,主要靠上身手臂发力。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hips turned less than 25° at the top, so your lower body isn't joining the swing and you're powering it mostly with your arms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 时髋转超过 60°,下半身储能流失,身体没有阻力。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top your hips turn past 60°, so the lower body leaks stored energy and there's no resistance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
