    "一键成片" : {

    },
    "上下杆比例大于 4:1，下杆失去爆发力，球速会偏低。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your backswing-to-downswing ratio is over 4:1, so the downswing loses its punch and ball speed drops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上下杆比例小于 2.5:1，下杆抢节奏。理想是 BS:DS = 3:1。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your backswing:downswing ratio is under 2.5:1 — you're rushing the downswing. Aim for BS:DS = 3:1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上传一段你之前录的挥杆，我们先帮你找出最该改的地方。也可以跳过，之后再做。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Upload a swing you recorded earlier and we'll find what to fix first. You can also skip and do it later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
