    "上杆幅度太短" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backswing too short"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时把重心压到右脚（后侧），而不是在顶点往目标方向倒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the backswing, load your weight into your trail foot—don't tip toward the target at the top."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时把髋和肩充分转进去，让前肩转到球的后方。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the backswing, turn your hips and shoulders fully so your lead shoulder turns behind the ball."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时把髋转进去——顶点时前膝应指向球或球的后方。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn your hips into the backswing-at the top your lead knee should point at the ball or just behind it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时整个身子往右滑出去了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your whole body slid out to the trail side on the backswing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时绕着右髋转，而不是整个身子往右滑出去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the backswing, turn around your trail hip instead of sliding your whole body to the right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上杆时髋部没转够" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hips don't turn enough on the backswing"
          }
        }
