    "下杆从地面发起——让髋先动、球杆顺势落到身后，而不是把杆往球的方向甩出去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start the downswing from the ground up. Let your hips move first and the club drop behind you, instead of throwing the club out toward the ball."
          }
        }
      }
    },
