          }
        }
      }
    },
    "击球时别把髋往目标方向平推——要把它转开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At impact, don't slide your hips toward the target—turn them open instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "击球时前腿应蹬直支撑 — " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At impact your lead leg should straighten and post up — "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "击球时前腿撑起来——感觉它蹬直、顶住地面把力量释放出去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Post up on your lead leg through impact-feel it straighten and push into the ground to release the power."
