            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your forearm bends at the elbow through impact — "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "击球时屁股往后顶住——想象后面有面墙，你正贴着墙坐下去。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At impact, push your backside back—imagine a wall behind you and sit into it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "击球时蹬地、把前腿蹬直，撑住地面、把速度释放出来。" : {
