          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顶点时把肩充分转过去，同时让髋部少转一些。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, turn your shoulders fully while letting your hips turn less."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顶点时让前臂转到与地面平行（或更高）——把上杆做完，别中途收住。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, get your forearm parallel to the ground (or higher)-finish the backswing, don't cut it short."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顶点时让后肘往下、收在肋骨前方——别让它抬离身体。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top, let your trail elbow point down and tuck in front of your ribs. Don't let it lift away from your body."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顶点时身子反而往目标侧倾" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At the top your body leans toward the target instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顶点时重心应该在右脚（后侧）——感觉往后脚里压，而不是往目标侧倒。" : {
